1
00:00:01,752 --> 00:00:03,752
Ow— that hurts!

2
00:00:04,294 --> 00:00:06,688
Serves you right.
That's nothing compared to what you pulled.

3
00:00:07,207 --> 00:00:08,323
I said no, and I meant it.

4
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:11,111
Alright, alright—
you're really serious about this.

5
00:00:11,411 --> 00:00:13,710
It's not like I'd force you or anything.

6
00:00:14,234 --> 00:00:15,602
So… where do you live anyway?

7
00:00:16,012 --> 00:00:16,644
Bang Khae.

8
00:00:16,739 --> 00:00:18,329
That's so far.

9
00:00:18,772 --> 00:00:19,883
Then why'd you choose to meet here?

10
00:00:20,562 --> 00:00:21,220
Because I wanted to meet you.

11
00:00:22,356 --> 00:00:22,856
Alright then—

12
00:00:23,670 --> 00:00:24,605
You shower here first.

13
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:26,443
I'll go home and change.

14
00:00:27,323 --> 00:00:28,842
Then we'll head to school together, okay?

15
00:00:29,393 --> 00:00:31,772
How? My books are at home.

16
00:00:32,210 --> 00:00:33,960
Skipping studying for one day
won't kill you.

17
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:35,322
I won't bring my books either.
I'll keep you company.

18
00:00:35,512 --> 00:00:37,067
Not paying attention is kinda my specialty.

19
00:00:38,211 --> 00:00:40,479
Fine, fine. I'll go shower then.

20
00:00:40,896 --> 00:00:41,728
Want help?

21
00:00:42,738 --> 00:00:43,996
Absolutely not, you idiot.

22
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:49,300
Hurry up then—
or I *will* go in there.

23
00:01:35,870 --> 00:01:37,239
See? You can behave when you want to.

24
00:01:46,432 --> 00:01:48,432
Frame—
